// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2770487197" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Arbiter Sands here. I've been chosen to help you all out with this 'recon' mission. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>So, let's go over the schedule that's been set up here. You're after these things call 'Hydra Heads' that live in the bottom of Paragon's sewer system. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>These Hydra have some sort of chemical that can be powerful in the right hands. Surprising, right? Powerful monster has powerful chemical. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>To get to these Hydra Heads, you'll have to go through three levels of sewers, which, from my readings, show that they're packed full of all of Paragon's little problems. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>I'll call you all back once you've made some headway. Have fun in the sewers, I'll be sipping some coffee here in my office."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P2902917259" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Not too surprising, the Hellions were never any sort of real threat to a group with your power. That was a compliment, by the way, I threw it out there, it's up to you to catch it. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>We'll send an Arbiter to meet you at the next level, he'll help you train your powers and all that good stuff. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>From what my dossier says, you'll be going up against the Vahzilok next. Sounds like fun, I really wish I could be there, but this coffee isn't going to drink itself, you know."
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P3528575483" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Did you know Dr. Vahzilok considers himself to be one of the good guys? I've heard about delusional, but he takes the cake. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Like last time, we'll be sending an Arbiter down to the next level to assist you.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>This report says the Lost have some sort of shanty town down below. Although, the operative spelled 'shanty' wrong. Sigh... do you see how hard it is trying to be an Arbiter when someone can't even spell shanty?"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P214882917" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Good job kicking those mutated homeless out of their homes. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>You know the drill, Arbiter, next level, etc. etc.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>You'll be down in the belly of the beast, or whatever sort of intense metaphor you want to associate with the bottom of sewers. All that's left is to take down those hydras. For the glory of Arachnos, or whatever glory you'd rather associate with this whole thing."
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P1569986802" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Well, that does it. Arachnos will happily take a portion of what you find, not a large amount, though. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>We might be an all-seeing organization bent on world domination, but we're not inconsiderate.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Our scientists will whip up something interesting for you all to use, but you'll have to just pick one so there's enough to go around. Share and share alike, that's how I see it."
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""

