// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_SL_1/_src/Trial_SL_1_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : CaptionSpawn_Hero 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1353649951" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Positron here. I'm monitoring your current progress in the sewers. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>We need all the help we can get in getting to the Hydra that are nesting deep beneath the sewer system. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>If you can stop the Hydra, SERAPH can use the chemicals from these particular Hydra to enhance your abilities. We need all the help we can get after the destruction of Galaxy City <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>To get to these Hydra Heads, you'll have to go through three levels of sewers. Unfortunately, they're filled with all sorts of criminals that have fled the surface. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>I'll keep in touch, good luck down there. Positron out."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P432158694" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Blue Steel will handle the interrogations with those Hellions. We'll see if they can get us any information about what the gang is up to <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>A member of Longbow will meet you at the next level to help you train your abilities, if you need it. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>And trust me, you will need it. The Vahzilok have made the next area of the sewers their home."
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P2609836818" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>If only Dr. Vahzilok used his talents for good... perhaps things would have turned out much differently. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Longbow has sent another one of their men out to assist you all down below. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>There are reports of psychic disturbances below. No doubt it's the Lost. Be extra careful, many heroes have gone after the Lost only to never be heard from again."
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P889378178" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Good work. We'll see if we can't help any of the Lost you brought in. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>A representative from Longbow will meet you down below. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>All that's left now is to deal with the two Hydra heads. Be extremely careful down there, you're entering its domain now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P2904164334" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>You did it! That should stop the Hydra from infecting the sewers beneath Paragon, at least for now. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>The scientists at SERAPH will work on the samples you've collected to see if we can come up with a more permanent solution. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>In the meantime, you can use some of the chemicals they developed to increase your own powers. Oh, and when you've reached Security Level 11, come see me some time in Steel Canyon. I could always use more help in defending our city. Positron out."
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :

